<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>챗봇</title>

  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/notification.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/chatbot.css">
</head>

<body>
  <div class="app-layout">
    <%- include('partials/sidebar', { activeMenu: 'guide' }) %>

    <main class="app-main">
      <%- include('partials/header', {
        title: '챗봇',
        pageTitle: 'AI 복약 도우미',
        pageDesc: '증상을 입력하면 내 약장에서 관련 약과 복용 정보를 알려드립니다',
        pageIcon: '/images/icons/pill.svg'
      }) %>

      <section class="page-content">
        <div class="chatbot-page">
          <h2>PillMate AI</h2>

          <div id="chatMessages" class="chat-messages">
            <div class="bot-message">
              안녕하세요! 증상을 입력하면 내 약장에서 관련 약을 찾아드릴게요.
              <br>
              예: 두통이 있고 열이 나요
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="chat-input-area">
            <input 
              type="text" 
              id="chatInput" 
              placeholder="증상을 입력하세요"
            >
            <button type="button" onclick="sendChatMessage()">전송</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script src="/js/chatbot.js"></script>
</body>
</html>